## Degraded

- `agent_mail` `missing`: reservation and inbox data may be incomplete. Use bead assignee and dirty paths as degraded fallback evidence.
- `rch` `missing`: remote proof routing may be unavailable. Defer heavy validation until rch status is ok or use script-only proof.
- `proof_evidence_index` `missing`: proof queries may be incomplete. Use explicit proof outcome snapshots until bd-p03vs lands.
- `validation_plan` `fail_closed`: planned validation cannot run safely. Fix unknown path mappings or ownership before running validation.
- `resource_governor` `defer`: resource admission is not green. Follow resource-governor remediation before starting heavy validation.
- `dirty_reserved_file` `degraded`: crates/franken-engine/src/semantic_dark_matter_engine.rs is dirty or reserved. Avoid this file or coordinate with the holder.
- `stale_proof_artifact` `degraded`: old-proof is stale. Refresh or mark the proof stale before relying on it.
- `proof_outcome` `blocked`: bd-0ub12 proof is not passing. Inspect the proof outcome before recommending dependent work.
- `blocked_bead_chain` `blocked`: bd-blocked is blocked in the bv track. Inspect dependencies before recommending this bead.
- `resource_leases` `missing`: resource lease admission artifact is missing. Provide --resource-lease-plan-json before publishing the operator status feed.
- `proof_cache` `missing`: proof reuse cache artifact is missing. Provide --proof-cache-plan-json before reusing prior proof artifacts.
- `qos_batches` `missing`: build-storm QoS batch artifact is missing. Provide --qos-batch-plan-json before publishing admission state.
- `stale_lock_recommendations` `missing`: stale-lock recommendation artifact is missing. Provide --stale-lock-recommendations-json before reopening stalled beads.
- `staged_contamination` `missing`: staged ownership guard artifact is missing. Provide --staged-ownership-report-json before commit or closeout.
- `capacity_forecast` `missing`: predictive capacity forecast artifact is missing. Provide --capacity-forecast-json before publishing forecast confidence.
- `admission_budgets` `missing`: admission budget plan artifact is missing. Provide --admission-budget-plan-json before summarizing budget posture.
- `lease_exchange_salvage` `missing`: lease-exchange salvage simulation artifact is missing. Provide --lease-exchange-salvage-simulation-json before recommending ownership reshuffles.
- `prefetch_roi` `missing`: warm-target prefetch ROI advisory artifact is missing. Provide --warm-target-prefetch-roi-advisory-json before recommending prefetch.
- `starvation_rescue_handoff` `missing`: starvation rescue handoff artifacts are incomplete. Provide both --starvation-rescue-plan-json and --starvation-rescue-conformance-report-json before trusting rescue readiness.
- `checkpoint_restore_handoff` `missing`: checkpoint restore handoff artifacts are incomplete. Provide --checkpoint-bundle-json, --checkpoint-restore-plan-json, and --checkpoint-restore-conformance-report-json before trusting restore readiness.
- `execution_queue_advisory` `missing`: execution queue runner artifacts are incomplete. Provide queue artifact, risk-budget receipt, bottleneck report, and run manifest before trusting queue advice.
- `queue_fidelity` `missing`: queue fidelity and tuning artifacts are incomplete. Provide fidelity receipt, drift ledger, counterfactual backtest, tuning plan, and frontier before trusting hindsight tuning advice.
- `rch_incident_packet` `worker_timeout`: rch proof execution has an incident packet. Retry only after narrowing the command.
